          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The relay rejected this family token. Messages will wait until the token is fixed — check it against another family phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service on their card is not accepting messages for them, so yours are waiting. Ask them to check their Cruise Pass is set up, then share their friend card again. Messages still deliver when you are near each other.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The service on their card is not accepting messages for them, so yours are waiting. Ask them to check their Cruise Pass is set up, then share their friend card again. Messages still deliver when you are near each other."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their friend card is out of date": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Their friend card is out of date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They won't be able to message you, and they won't appear as a suggested friend. They won't be told. Scanning their card again unblocks them.": {
